# Where each Vitrail preference lives: one "<file> <key>" per line.
#
# <file> is ~/.config/vitrail/<file>.ini, named after the area of the settings
# window that shows the key. This is the single source of truth: Python
# (vitrail/prefs.py), the bar (bar/prefs.js), the apply script
# (scripts/lib/ini.sh) and the systemd path unit all follow it, and
# tests/test_prefs_map.py checks that every key used anywhere is listed here
# exactly once. A key that is not listed is written to misc.ini.
#
# Keys shared by several pages (radius, blurStrength, surfaceStyle,
# surfaceOpacity) live with the page that owns them: Appearance.

appearance appearance
appearance surfaceStyle
appearance surfaceOpacity
appearance radius
appearance blurStrength
appearance spacing
appearance fontBase

colors colorScheme
colors colorContrast

